//   Expected-label policy (see gen_hmao_collision_e2e_dataset.py header for the
//   full rationale): clearance < -0.5 m -> assert VETO;
//   clearance > 3.0 m -> assert GRANT; otherwise BOUNDARY (log only,
//   no pass/fail assertion -- HMAO's real zonotope+SAT+ADMM decision in that
//   band is not predictable from a simple point-to-polyline distance alone).
// =============================================================================

